  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-akshare-one",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：股票数据接口服务\n\n基于akshare-one的MCP服务器，提供中国股票市场数据的全面接口，包括历史数据、实时数据、新闻数据和财务报表等金融信息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **get_hist_data** — Get historical stock market data. 'eastmoney_direct' support all A,B,H shares\n- **get_realtime_data** — Get real-time stock market data. 'eastmoney_direct' support all A,B,H shares\n- **get_news_data** — Get stock-related news data.\n- **get_balance_sheet** — Get company balance sheet data.\n- **get_income_statement** — Get company income statement data.\n- **get_cash_flow** — Get company cash flow statement data.\n- **get_inner_trade_data** — Get company insider trading data.\n- **get_financial_metrics** — Get key financial metrics from the three major financial statements.\n- **get_time_info** — Get current time with ISO format, timestamp, and the last trading day."
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-akshare-one\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-akshare-one\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
